id: pm-ohgg1b
title: "GH-1510: make relationship packet cursor recovery command-aware"
description: "Published-release report: deps context --cursor bad instructs removal of --after, which that command rejects. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1510 . This is distinct from scoped tracker recovery completed in the predecessor."
