acceptance_criteria: Reproduce malformed and stale cursor refusals in isolated trackers; execute emitted recovery argv; verify CLI JSON and MCP parity with declared runtime flags.
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: Add optional cursorFlag arguments to the public pagination primitives and use --cursor for relationship packets. Return a fresh scope-preserving deps retry while retaining traversal and output policy and propagating unrelated errors. Document and snapshot all six declarations.
expected_result: Malformed or mismatched relationship cursors identify the supported flag and provide executable retry argv for the selected tracker.
actual_result: "Malformed and mismatched CLI SDK and MCP refusals preserve executable retry facts; emitted CLI argv succeeds. Explicit and default budget controls plus unrelated error identity pass. Bounded mutation passes345/352 with seven existing equivalents at the raised98.01136363636364floor. PR1515 code head7ba76fd6ce2d43937e0c490343e8c9e195d7a82c: CI39376468501 passed all required hosted checks; exact coverage lines66214/66214 statements69818/69818 functions14387/14387 branches53652/53652. DeepScan0new and CodeFactor0annotations. Final review test improvement passes the focused linked transport suite. Original failed local performance and mutation-timeout receipts remain failed."
